      "id": "6acf54a8788da890f985d86e",
      "fieldData": {
       "acrm---integration-feature-4": "<h3>21 of 38 referred friends have booked</h3><p>Brightside Home Cleaning grows by word of mouth. Each customer gets a personal code, and when a referred friend's first clean is done, both get $50 off their next visit. This quarter the owner's dashboard shows 38 referrals, 21 booked and $2,100 in credits issued. The top referrer, Meg Torres, has sent 4 friends.</p>"
      }
     },
     {
      "id": "6accb96b8570d8ef2122bdea",
      "fieldData": {
       "awb---key-feature-1-content": "<h3>House rules the tenant signs before move-in</h3><p>One link goes to the new tenant of a spare room. They enter a move-in date and an emergency contact, then read the house rules: quiet after 10 pm, overnight guests for 3 nights at most. Rent is $950, due on the 1st. The agreement goes out for signature the moment they submit.</p>"
      }
     }
